		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 现代服装视觉词库｜批次01\n\n**十元现代基础服装：10/10**\n\n题材：现代女性／中性日常服装\n\n每张卡含：真实图、来源、结构、十元配比度、本征准度、五行狭义、误判边界。\n\n[[SKILL.md|S级建库Skill]]　[[00_现代服装五行狭义映射.md|五行狭义表]]　[[01_十元本征映射准度排行榜.md|本征排行榜]]","x":-800,"y":-900,"width":1600,"height":580,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-木","type":"group","label":"木｜现代服装狭义","x":-1250,"y":0,"width":2500,"height":1100,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"item-07","type":"text","text":"## 07｜多袋短款机能夹克\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/46376663163024594/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：NILI LOTAN Edna cropped wool-gabardine jacket  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/nili-lotan/clothing/casual-jackets/edna-cropped-wool-gabardine-jacket/46376663163024594)\n\n**结构**：短款修身；硬挺尖领；按扣／前扣；结构羊毛嘎巴甸；胸前翻盖口袋、袖口扣。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `zx`／副 `nx`  \n**配比度**：`zx 86%／nx 14%`  \n**本征准度**：`zx 92/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：木／阳木 zx  \n**服装狭义**：主动功能部署 → 木  \n**叙事显影**：因果\n\n**证据**：口袋、按扣与硬挺领形成可立即调用的功能节点。\n\n**误判**：口袋若只是装饰，或制服秩序更强，应转向xn。","x":-1100,"y":100,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"item-08","type":"text","text":"## 08｜柔软垂肩长开衫\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/1647597332865898/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：LAUREN MANOOGIAN Column ribbed stretch-Pima cotton cardigan  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-hk/shop/product/lauren-manoogian/clothing/cardigans/column-ribbed-stretch-pima-cotton-cardigan/1647597332865898)\n\n**结构**：松垮长直；垂肩；可开放前襟；弹力Pima棉罗纹；低贴体。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `nx`／副 `zx`  \n**配比度**：`nx 84%／zx 16%`  \n**本征准度**：`nx 90/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：木／阴木 nx  \n**服装狭义**：顺势续接 → 木  \n**叙事显影**：因果\n\n**证据**：柔软、垂肩和开放前襟沿身体与已有内搭续接。\n\n**误判**：硬边、功能扣件或强造型主动改向时，zx会上升。","x":150,"y":100,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-火","type":"group","label":"火｜现代服装狭义","x":-1250,"y":1250,"width":2500,"height":1100,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"item-01","type":"text","text":"## 01｜基础白色圆领T恤\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/19971654707617826/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：LESET Margo cotton-jersey T-shirt  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-us/shop/product/leset/clothing/t-shirts/margo-cotton-jersey-t-shirt/19971654707617826)\n\n**结构**：直身放松；常规长度；圆领短袖；套头；纯棉针织；基础内层／可单穿。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `zn`／副 `x`  \n**配比度**：`zn 78%／x 22%`  \n**本征准度**：`zn 93/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：火／阳火 zn  \n**服装狭义**：基础本体层 → 火  \n**叙事显影**：本体\n\n**证据**：去除复杂剪裁与外部功能，保留最低成立覆盖层。\n\n**误判**：紧身、收束、塑形主导时，应转向x。","x":-1100,"y":1350,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"item-02","type":"text","text":"## 02｜修身半透高领打底衫\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/46376663162908438/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：JIL SANDER Jersey turtleneck top  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/jil-sander/clothing/turtleneck/jersey-turtleneck-top/46376663162908438)\n\n**结构**：修身贴体；高领长袖；套头；半透弹性针织；高贴体；打底内层。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `x`／副 `zn`  \n**配比度**：`x 80%／zn 20%`  \n**本征准度**：`x 90/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：火／阴火 x  \n**服装狭义**：身体控制边界 → 火  \n**叙事显影**：本体\n\n**证据**：高领和修身面料把身体压入连续控制边界。\n\n**误判**：半透明不等于xz，贴体控制才是决定结构。","x":150,"y":1350,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"group-土","type":"group","label":"土｜现代服装狭义","x":-1250,"y":2500,"width":2500,"height":1100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"item-06","type":"text","text":"## 06｜宽松衬衫式外套\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/46376663163038501/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：ALLUDE Open-knit wool and cashmere-blend overshirt  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/allude/clothing/cardigans/open-knit-wool-and-cashmere-blend-overshirt/46376663163038501)\n\n**结构**：宽松衬衫式；尖领；前开；开放针织羊毛羊绒；内外过渡层。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `n`／副 `x并z`  \n**配比度**：`n 76%／x并z 24%`  \n**本征准度**：`n 89/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：土／阳土 n  \n**服装狭义**：层间接入 → 土  \n**叙事显影**：空间\n\n**证据**：连接内搭、外套和环境，而非优先封闭身体。\n\n**误判**：强封闭壳体提高x并z；柔软让位主导提高nx。","x":-1100,"y":2600,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"item-05","type":"text","text":"## 05｜长款系带风衣\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/1647597325109264/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：BURBERRY Kensington Long organic cotton-gabardine trench coat  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/burberry/clothing/trench-coats/kensington-long-organic-cotton-gabardine-trench-coat/1647597325109264)\n\n**结构**：长直身；小腿长度；翻领；双排扣＋腰带；棉嘎巴甸；防风片与包裹前襟。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `x并z`／副 `n`  \n**配比度**：`x并z 85%／n 15%`  \n**本征准度**：`x并z 94/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：土／阴土 x并z  \n**服装狭义**：包裹外壳 → 土  \n**叙事显影**：空间\n\n**证据**：围合身体并形成可开合、可收束的稳定外部接口。\n\n**误判**：垂坠漂移和不确定落点更强时，xz会上升。","x":150,"y":2600,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"group-金","type":"group","label":"金｜现代服装狭义","x":-1250,"y":3750,"width":2500,"height":1100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"item-03","type":"text","text":"## 03｜结构肩双排扣西装外套\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/46376663162855745/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：SAINT LAURENT Double-breasted wool blazer  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/saint-laurent/clothing/blazers/double-breasted-wool-blazer/46376663162855745)\n\n**结构**：结构直肩；盖臀；戗驳领；双排扣；羊毛；对称扣位和肩垫。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `xn`／副 `z`  \n**配比度**：`xn 88%／z 12%`  \n**本征准度**：`xn 95/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：金／阳金 xn  \n**服装狭义**：剪裁秩序 → 金  \n**叙事显影**：时间\n\n**证据**：对称重复、固定扣序、肩线与驳领建立可复制规则。\n\n**误判**：极端短截或局部焦点压倒整体秩序时，z会上升。","x":-1100,"y":3850,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"item-04","type":"text","text":"## 04｜短截腰短款夹克\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/46376663162865512/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：EMILIA WICKSTEAD Lizette cropped wool-crepe jacket  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/emilia-wickstead/clothing/smart/lizette-cropped-wool-crepe-jacket/46376663162865512)\n\n**结构**：修身短款；腰线上方截断；简洁领口；前扣；羊毛绉；中高贴体。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `z`／副 `xn`  \n**配比度**：`z 82%／xn 18%`  \n**本征准度**：`z 91/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：金／阴金 z  \n**服装狭义**：截断节点 → 金  \n**叙事显影**：时间\n\n**证据**：短下摆把纵向路径裁定到明确腰线节点。\n\n**误判**：多袋功能或解构方向更强时，应转向zx或xz。","x":150,"y":3850,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"group-水","type":"group","label":"水｜现代服装狭义","x":-1250,"y":5000,"width":2500,"height":1100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"item-09","type":"text","text":"## 09｜不对称垂坠半裙\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/46376663163032188/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：CHLOÉ Asymmetric draped cotton-poplin skirt  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/chloe/clothing/midi/asymmetric-draped-cotton-poplin-skirt/46376663163032188)\n\n**结构**：不对称A形；中长；腰部集中垂褶；高低差下摆；褶量沿一侧下落。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `xz`／副 `nz`  \n**配比度**：`xz 88%／nz 12%`  \n**本征准度**：`xz 94/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：水／阳水 xz  \n**服装狭义**：漂移收窄 → 水  \n**叙事显影**：命运\n\n**证据**：布量持续偏向一侧并收窄到非均衡落点。\n\n**误判**：明确回卷、复位或双向转换时，nz会增强。","x":-1100,"y":5100,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"item-10","type":"text","text":"## 10｜双面可逆皮革羊羔毛夹克\n\n![](https://www.net-a-porter.com/variants/images/46376663163046084/in/w2000_q60.jpg)\n\n**原文**：ARMA Lucine reversible leather and shearling jacket  \n**来源**：[NET-A-PORTER](https://www.net-a-porter.com/en-kr/shop/product/arma/clothing/casual-jackets/lucine-reversible-leather-and-shearling-jacket/46376663163046084)\n\n**结构**：宽松短外套；双面可穿；皮革／羊羔毛两面；翻转后保持完整功能。\n\n**正式十元**：主 `nz`／副 `xz`  \n**配比度**：`nz 90%／xz 10%`  \n**本征准度**：`nz 96/100`｜批次第1/1\n\n**五行**：水／阴水 nz  \n**服装狭义**：回返路径保留 → 水  \n**叙事显影**：命运\n\n**证据**：同一服装保存两套可返回的完整状态。\n\n**误判**：必须真正可逆穿着，且两面都构成完整有效状态。","x":150,"y":5100,"width":1050,"height":900,"color":"2"}
	],
